          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\bar x = 31/5 = 6.2$, $S_{xx}=\\sum(x-\\bar x)^2 = 1.44+0.04+0.64+4.84+7.84 = 14.8$. The standard error of the intercept is $\\mathrm{se}(\\hat\\beta_0)=\\hat\\sigma\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{n}+\\dfrac{\\bar x^2}{S_{xx}}} = 1.56\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{5}+\\dfrac{6.2^2}{14.8}} = 1.56\\sqrt{0.2+2.5973} = 1.56(1.6725) = 2.61 \\approx 2.6$. (Cross-check: fitting the line gives $\\hat\\beta_1 = 7.2/14.8 = 0.4865$, $SS_E = 10.8-0.4865(7.2)=7.30$, $\\hat\\sigma=\\sqrt{7.30/3}=1.56$ — matching the value given.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\bar x = 31/5 = 6.2$, $S_{xx}=\\sum(x-\\bar x)^2 = 1.44+0.04+0.64+4.84+7.84 = 14.8$. Sai số chuẩn của hệ số chặn là $\\mathrm{se}(\\hat\\beta_0)=\\hat\\sigma\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{n}+\\dfrac{\\bar x^2}{S_{xx}}} = 1.56\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{5}+\\dfrac{6.2^2}{14.8}} = 1.56\\sqrt{0.2+2.5973} = 1.56(1.6725) = 2.61 \\approx 2.6$. (Kiểm chéo: khớp đường hồi quy cho $\\hat\\beta_1 = 7.2/14.8 = 0.4865$, $SS_E = 10.8-0.4865(7.2)=7.30$, $\\hat\\sigma=\\sqrt{7.30/3}=1.56$ — đúng bằng giá trị đề cho.)</p></div>"
