          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Equal variances are assumed, so pool them: $s_p^2=\\dfrac{(n_1-1)s_1^2+(n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2}=\\dfrac{17(441)+13(225)}{30}=\\dfrac{7497+2925}{30}=\\dfrac{10422}{30}=347.4$, so $s_p=18.64$. Then $t_0=\\dfrac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{s_p\\sqrt{1/n_1+1/n_2}}=\\dfrac{30}{18.64\\sqrt{1/18+1/14}}=\\dfrac{30}{18.64(0.35635)}=\\dfrac{30}{6.642}=4.517$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Giả thiết phương sai bằng nhau nên gộp lại: $s_p^2=\\dfrac{(n_1-1)s_1^2+(n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2}=\\dfrac{17(441)+13(225)}{30}=\\dfrac{7497+2925}{30}=\\dfrac{10422}{30}=347.4$, suy ra $s_p=18.64$. Khi đó $t_0=\\dfrac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{s_p\\sqrt{1/n_1+1/n_2}}=\\dfrac{30}{18.64\\sqrt{1/18+1/14}}=\\dfrac{30}{18.64(0.35635)}=\\dfrac{30}{6.642}=4.517$.</p></div>"
